---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../../../styles/equipment.css';
import checks from '../../../../../public/equipment/08-08/verification.json';
import m from '../../../../../public/equipment/08-08/interactions.json';
const a='/equipment/08-08/',doc='https://amadaweldtech.com/product/wl-300a-laser-welding-workstation/',photo='https://www.amada.ca/Fiber-Laser-Welding';
const fields=[['widthMm','Width (mm)',0,60,20],['heightMm','Height (mm)',0,60,12],['shiftXmm','Draft shift X (mm)',-4,4,0],['shiftYmm','Draft shift Y (mm)',-4,4,0],['yawDeg','Draft yaw (°)',-22,22,0],['bandMm','Review band ± mm',.025,1,.1]];
const show=x=>typeof x==='string'?x:Object.entries(x).map(([k,v])=>k+': '+(typeof v==='number'?Number(v.toPrecision(8)):String(v))).join('; ');
---
<Layout pageTitle="AMADA WL-300A passive seam-fit bench" subtitle="" description="Review rectangular package seam coverage without a laser or welding model." wide={true}>
<article id="seam" class="equipment"><nav class="eq-nav"><a href="/simulations/equipment/08-08/">← Equipment 08-08</a><a href="/simulations/equipment/">Equipment register</a><a href="#seam-checks">Verification</a></nav>
<header><p class="eq-meta">08-08 / Packaging / Passive optical layout</p><h2>AMADA WL-300A</h2><p>Inspect the fit of a draft rectangle on a 20 × 12 mm inert package. A closed draft covers all 64 mm. Remove the east edge and coverage drops to 52 mm (81.25%). This is a visual review bench only, not a welder.</p></header>
<div class="e-grid"><section class="e-card"><h3>01 · Inspect the cabinet</h3><div id="seam-views" class="e-row">{['Bench','Front','Side','Fixture'].map(k=><button data-view={k.toLowerCase()}>{k}</button>)}<button id="seam-xr" disabled>VR unavailable</button></div>
<canvas id="seam-model" aria-label="Orbitable AMADA enclosure with virtual shroud and inert package"></canvas><p id="seam-asset" role="status">Loading metric GLB…</p><p>Click the shroud to raise/lower it, the fixture to place the virtual package, or the display to review geometry. Drag to orbit; scroll or pinch to zoom. Equivalent controls are available on the form.</p></section>
<section class="e-card"><h3>02 · Review the draft perimeter</h3><form id="seam-form"><div class="e-row"><button id="seam-door" type="button">Lift inspection shroud</button><button id="seam-seat" type="button">Unseat virtual package</button><button id="seam-missing" type="button">Toggle missing east edge</button></div>
<div class="e-fields"><label>Specimen ID<input name="sampleId" value="inert-package-rect-01" maxlength="96" required/></label><label>Omit edge<select name="missingEdge">{['none','north','east','south','west'].map(k=><option value={k}>{k}</option>)}</select></label>
{fields.map(([k,t,l,h,v])=><label>{t}<input name={k} type="number" min={l} max={h} step="any" value={v}/></label>)}</div><div class="e-row"><button id="seam-run" class="e-run" type="submit">Inspect layout</button><button id="seam-reset" type="button">Restore example</button></div></form><p id="seam-status" role="status">Shroud down. Package seated.</p></section></div>
<section class="e-card"><h3>03 · Read the perimeter</h3><p id="seam-result" role="status">No layout evaluated. Leak rate unknown.</p><svg id="seam-chart" viewBox="0 0 475 265" role="img" aria-label="Nominal package rectangle and transformed geometric draft"></svg><div class="e-row"><button id="seam-json" disabled>Layout JSON</button><button id="seam-csv" disabled>Edge coverage CSV</button></div></section>
<section><h3>Selected exterior reference</h3><p>The register did not name a product model. This selects the documented WL-300A solid-front enclosure: W/H/D 1,086 × 1,880 × 876 mm closed, excluding the ergonomic arm per the <a href={doc}>manufacturer’s product geometry</a>. The actual example uses a camera display rather than a clear viewing window. Compare <a href={photo}>AMADA Canada exterior photograph</a>. The fixture, interior and display are original approximations without source optics, machinery or calibrated motion.</p><div class="e-grid"><figure><img src={a+'front.svg'} width="760" height="450" alt="Original closed WL-300A enclosure projection"/></figure><figure><img src={a+'work.svg'} width="760" height="450" alt="Original passive interior fixture with raised shroud"/></figure></div></section>
<section><h3>Inspection model</h3><p>Translate and rotate a draft in package-local XY (mm). Each named edge clips to the corresponding nominal edge’s tangent interval and perpendicular review band; its projected length counts toward coverage. Missing edges contribute zero. This is a conservative edge-by-edge layout comparison rather than a motion program. No active laser, settings, process sequences, material transformation or leak-rate inference is present.</p><p>JSON and CSV retain package ID, revision, per-edge coverage and unknown leak-test status. Passing layout does not imply a sealed or welded package. <a href={a+'output-schema.json'}>Output schema</a> · <a href={a+'example-result.json'}>Example layout result</a>.</p></section>
<section id="seam-checks"><h3>Verification and files</h3><div class="e-over"><table><thead><tr><th>Case</th><th>Expected</th><th>Actual</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>{checks.map(r=><tr><td>{r.id}</td><td>{show(r.expected)}</td><td>{show(r.actual)}</td><td>{r.pass?'Pass':'Fail'}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div><p><a href={a+'reference-plan.json'}>Predeclared cases</a> · <a href={a+'verification.json'}>Evidence</a> · <a href={a+'amada-wl-300a.glb'} download>Metric GLB</a> · <a href={a+'geometry-source.mjs'}>Editable geometry</a> + <a href={a+'make-model.mjs'}>generator</a> + <a href={a+'mesh-writer.mjs'}>mesh writer</a> · <a href={a+'interactions.json'}>Interaction targets</a>. {m.triangles.toLocaleString()} triangles and {m.draws} draw primitives. Optional WebXR; physical headset untested.</p></section></article></Layout>
<script>import '../../../../lib/equipment/08-08/client.mjs';</script>
<style>
#seam header{max-width:73ch;padding:1.3rem 0}#seam h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,6vw,4rem);margin:.2rem 0}#seam section{margin:1rem 0}.e-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem}.e-card{border:1px solid var(--border);padding:.8rem;min-width:0}.e-card h3{margin:.3rem 0}.e-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.4rem;margin:.5rem 0}.e-fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.55rem}.e-fields label{display:grid;gap:.2rem}.e-fields input,#seam button{min-width:0;min-height:2.45rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px;background:var(--panel);color:var(--text);font:inherit;padding:.3rem .5rem;box-sizing:border-box}#seam button:disabled{opacity:.52}.e-run{background:#3d596e!important;color:white!important}#seam-model{width:100%;height:clamp(280px,34vw,440px);display:block;background:#ebe8e0;touch-action:none}#seam-chart{width:100%;max-height:13rem}.e-over{overflow:auto}#seam table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:.85rem}#seam td,#seam th{text-align:left;padding:.45rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}#seam figure{margin:0}#seam img{width:100%;height:auto}@media(max-width:820px){.e-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.e-fields{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}
</style>
